{"sections":[{"slug":"伪球","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"伪球"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">伪球</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“伪球”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">在极坐标下</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">通常的球面具有</span> Riemann <span lang=\"zh\">度量</span>\n$$\r\nds^2 = R^2 (d\\theta^2 + \\sin^2\\theta \\,d\\phi^2).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其标量曲率为</span> $1/R^2$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">将正弦函数改为双曲正弦</span>,\n$$\r\nds^2 = R^2 (d\\lambda ^2 + \\sinh^2\\lambda  \\,d\\phi^2),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">所得的曲面称为</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">伪球</span></strong> (pseudosphere), <span lang=\"zh\">其标量曲率为</span> $K=-1/R^2$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">将坐标</span> $\\lambda$ <span lang=\"zh\">替换为</span> $r = \\dfrac{\\sinh\\lambda}{1+\\cosh\\lambda}$, <span lang=\"zh\">得到度量的另一表示形式</span>\n$$\r\nds^2 = \\frac{4}{(1-r^2)^2}(dr^2+r^2 \\, d\\phi^2)\\,(r&lt;1)\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">令</span> $(x,y)=(r\\cos\\phi,r\\sin\\phi)$ <span lang=\"zh\">得到直角坐标下的表示</span>\n$$\r\nds^2 = \\frac{4}{(1-x^2-y^2)^2}(dx^2+dy^2)\\,(x^2+y^2&lt;1).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">这时伪球也叫</span> Poincaré <span lang=\"zh\">圆盘</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">伪球不能嵌入</span> $3$ <span lang=\"zh\">维欧氏空间</span>.</p>\n<h2>Möbius <span lang=\"zh\">变换</span></h2>\n"}}}]}